      "writtenOn": "2025-10-15T13:35:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The DELEG24/DELEG25 tests are currently passing because they seem to work fine with traditional delegation types (OPEN_DELEGATE_WRITE/READ) and as you mentioned we need to support other types as per NFSv4.2.\n\nI have responded with more information to both the comments on how we could address them. Please let me know if you\u0027d prefer a different approach!",
      "revId": "8ebf2606db64b33be13eafe3bbfd0640992c7ac5",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8f9eef41_c29c670f",
        "filename": "src/Protocols/NFS/nfs_proto_tools.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 2717,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003571
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-14T20:23:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Trying to understand the RFC, but I think we need to set other bits. This looks like it supports the client query to determine which options OPEN supports.\n\nAnd it seems like we should do something with that flag set on an OPEN?",
      "revId": "8ebf2606db64b33be13eafe3bbfd0640992c7ac5",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9c157be6_52664e84",
        "filename": "src/Protocols/NFS/nfs_proto_tools.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 2717,
      "author": {
        "id": 1038782
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-15T13:35:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per RFC 9754 Section 3, this attribute allows clients to query server\ncapabilities before using optional OPEN features. The open_arguments4 structure\ncontains 5 bitmaps representing different aspects of OPEN support.\n\nCurrently, I\u0027m only setting oa_share_access_want with DELEG_TIMESTAMPS. \nI will update encode_open_arguments() to properly advertise:\n- oa_share_access: Supported access modes (READ, WRITE, BOTH)\n- oa_share_deny: Supported deny modes (NONE, READ, WRITE, BOTH)\n- oa_share_access_want: All supported delegation hints including timestamps\n- oa_open_claim: (can remain empty - supports all standard claim types)\n- oa_create_mode: (can remain empty - supports all standard create modes)",
      "parentUuid": "8f9eef41_c29c670f",
      "revId": "8ebf2606db64b33be13eafe3bbfd0640992c7ac5",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
